7 - Notes
    -----

    L001 is not an executable checker package. Its executable substrate remains
    M001; L001 contributes certified fixed-point, collapse, obstruction, and
    contract endpoints.

    The most compact reading of the main result is:

      ClosureEvaluationFrame C Code
      ClosureModusPonens C
      ClosureConsistent C
      ClosureDecision C
        ==> False

    The regulator-facing version replaces `C` with
    `RegulatorClosure profile T Gamma` and uses M001's closure
    modus-ponens lemma.
